                                "sense_id": "8457ae59-e77e-35e1-8fca-6cd6177e39f4",
                                "text": "English spelling, although unphonetic and antiphonetic, was inherited from our ancestors and has served magnificently in the glorious past. The weak spot in English spelling, however, can be easily healed with the global alphabet."
